'''Highroad Junction''' is a small town in the [[Northern Wilds]], south of [[Snowhill]]. Players now start from the [[Cobblestone Village]] upon first arrival.

==Points of Interest==
*Highroad Junction Adoption Center
*Bear Cave
*Dance Party
*Highroad Junction Tavern
*[[Highroad Junction Playground]]
*[[Highroad Vale]]

==Job Trainers==
*Mercy Merrywings ([[Pet Trainer]])
*Veril Shiverwings (Pet Trainer)
*Auguste Frydaze ([[Chef]] Trainer)
*Harold ([[Brawler]] Trainer)

==Shops==
*Potions (health, energy, replenishing)
*Pet Collars
*Pet Supplies

==Local [[Dungeons]]==
*[[Hewey's Escape]] (removed)

